# Transfer / staging archives: the tree itself is the source of truth
*.tgz
*.tar.gz
*.zip

# Logs are ignored by default (emulator and firmware demo logs are large and regenerable:
# `python3 sim/emu_device.py --out logs/demo.log`, `make -C firmware/ref logs`) ...
*.log
# ... except the ones that are evidence or test inputs:
!rtl/**/results/*.log
!rtl/wave2/run_all.log
!lab3/dataset/raw/*.log
